; crouches). Skipped while he flashes or is already hit. Fire (type 14) only hurts at its full
; flare (size class 10). A touch knocks him back (g_ArthurState 1, pushed away from the enemy),
; except with the cheat on once his armour is gone.
;---------------------------------------------------------------------------
EnemyVsArthur:
        tst.b   g_ArthurFlash(a6)               ; 08E08/08E66
        bne.b   l_08E8C                         ; 08E0C/08E6A
