; line-interleaved) to a2, writing after every plane line a mask line (the OR of the
; 5 planes). a3 -> (width in pixels, height) words per block.
;---------------------------------------------------------------------------
BuildMaskedGfx:
        moveq   #$f,d4                          ;      /0C304
        add.w   (a3)+,d4                        ;      /0C306
        lsr.w   #$4,d4                          ;      /0C308
        move.w  (a3)+,d5                        ;      /0C30A
